msgid "`Authorization: Bearer <token>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md e57782729ce847569f9097cbc9ad59ee
msgid "a browser"
msgstr "瀏覽器"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md c345634259244a4590707710a7b07729
msgid "`token.<token>` in the subprotocol list, beside `qlservice.v2`"
msgstr "子協定清單中的 `token.<token>`，放在 `qlservice.v2` 旁邊"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:759 3ebb7674e1f4443f8ae22b47c3011eb0
msgid ""
"A browser gets the second row because it cannot set headers: `new "
"WebSocket` takes a URL and a list of subprotocols and nothing else. The "
"service answers with exactly one protocol, never the token, since a "
"browser fails a handshake in which it named protocols and the server "
"selected none. A URL query string would be the third option and is the "
"worst of the three: a URL reaches logs, history and referrers."
msgstr ""
"瀏覽器用第二列，是因為它無法設定標頭：`new WebSocket` 只接受一個 URL "
"與一份子協定清單，其他什麼都不收。服務只回應恰好一個協定，絕不回應權杖，因為如果瀏覽器指名了協定而伺服器一個都沒選，瀏覽器會讓握手失敗。URL "
"查詢字串會是第三種做法，也是三者中最糟的：URL 會流進日誌、瀏覽紀錄與 referrer。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:766 aea33333e7ad444b85e150fb70b72a93
msgid ""
"A wrong token and a missing one are the same `401`, for the reason a "
"refused resume is one answer. The log says which."
msgstr "錯誤的權杖和沒帶權杖都是同樣的 `401`，理由和被拒絕的接回只有一種答案相同。日誌會記下是哪一種。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:769 30d555c580a0410388c2412c08ff339e
msgid ""
"**Fail closed on the address.** `--host` anywhere but loopback, with no "
"token, is refused at startup with exit code 2 rather than served. "
"Everything above is a door against a page and none of it is a boundary "
"against the network, so an unauthenticated pricing engine answering a "
"routable address is an accident far more often than a decision."
msgstr ""
"**位址上預設拒絕。**`--host` 設為 loopback 以外的位址卻沒有權杖時，會在啟動時以結束碼 2 "
"拒絕，而不是照常服務。以上一切都是擋頁面的門，沒有一樣是抵擋網路的邊界，所以一個未經驗證、在可路由位址上回應的計價引擎，是意外的機會遠遠大於刻意的決定。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:775 254af9588c0e4999a834efae63199915
msgid ""
"**What is deliberately not here.** TLS, and users. The token is one "
"shared secret rather than an identity, and anything that can read the "
"token file can present it, so it keeps out another user's process and not"
" one running as that user. If this is ever served off the machine it runs"
" on, a reverse proxy terminates TLS, authenticates and checks origin, and"
" `ql-backend` goes on binding to loopback behind it. A pricing engine "
"that grew its own TLS stack would be a worse pricing engine and a worse "
"edge server."
msgstr "**刻意不放在這裡的東西**。TLS，以及使用者。權杖是一個共用密鑰而不是身分，任何讀得到權杖檔的東西都能出示它，所以它擋得住其他使用者的行程，擋不住以同一位使用者身分執行的行程。如果哪天要在它所執行的機器之外提供服務，就由反向代理終結 TLS、進行驗證並檢查來源，而 `ql-backend` 繼續在它後面綁定 loopback。一個自己長出 TLS 堆疊的計價引擎，會是更差的計價引擎，也是更差的邊緣伺服器。"

